WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:02.760
Long time no see, Ray.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:03.700
Look at this.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.820
What's so special about it?

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.920
Holy crap!

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:14.220
Relax, he's my nephew.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.060
Where do you want him?

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:18.720
How much?

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.100
Welcome.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:23.760
Welcome to the league.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.440
Hello, Ray.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.800
Let me guess.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.040
You're a client?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.020
Paid up front.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.740
What are we doing wrong, Eye-Ra?

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:36.000
It's hard being the only

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.880
honest players in a crooked game.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:40.460
Okay.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.100
Still got it!

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.840
Ladies and gentlemen, Venus Nova!

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:53.000
Venus Nova is about to launch her biggest album.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:56.040
I'm hiring you, Gunn. Keep her out

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.820
of trouble, and you'll be a very rich man.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.443
Mr. Gunn, I keep thinking

00:01:01.443 --> 00:01:03.520
there are no nice surprises anymore.

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:05.120
And then you show up.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:06.980
Be careful, Ray.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.260
Nova's a tortured artist.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:13.660
The art is expensive.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.200
The torture...

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:18.020
is free.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.000
Come, boy, come along.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.700
I trust you're house-broken.

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:22.440
Maybe.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.060
But I'm rethinking it.

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:28.640
Strap in, buster.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.340
Venus Nova is crazy.

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:35.520
I have information on Venus that could sink her.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:39.080
My gut says this is much bigger than I thought.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.620
Who are we watching?

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.020
Everyone.

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:50.480
This city has corruption.

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:54.140
Secrets.

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:56.080
And murder.

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:01.920
It's my job to discover the truth.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.320
Find him.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:09.560
What are you gonna do?

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:11.120
It always ends with a bang.

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:19.200
We should ask for more money.
